What is DeltΔAddons?
---------------
DeltΔAddons is a custom vendor tree to add extras to your android ROMs. It adds unique sounds and wallpapers, privacy-respecting apps, and useful utitilies.

Implement it!
---------------
## Download it straight into your local_manifests
* Using curl
```bash
mkdir local_manifests
curl -o .repo/local_manifests/deltaAddons.xml <url>
```
* Using wget
```bash
wget -P .repo/local_manifests/deltaAddons.xml <url>
```

## Integrate it to your ROM source manifests
* Download it to snippets/
    * Using curl
    ```bash
    curl -o .repo/manifests/snippets/deltaAddons.xml <url>
    ```
    * Using wget
    ```bash
    wget -P .repo/manifests/snippets/deltaAddons.xml <url>
    ```
* Comment the project path on other .xml's related to these:
    * Backgrounds
    * Launcher3 (optional)
* Integrate with `default.xml`
```xml
<include name="snippets/deltaAddons.xml" />
```
